5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to plan this year's training camp! We should really make sure the costs are fair for everyone this time. Let's figure out where we're going!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see your enthusiasm, Mio. I agree that we should be thoughtful about the costs, but let's also ensure the destination brings us all closer together. I look forward to our discussion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be practical. To avoid any unnecessary stress or burnout during the planning process, we need to look at the logistics carefully. Let's start by gathering the necessary data.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for an adventure! But we can't have everyone getting grumpy and tired like last time. Let's find a place that's actually fun and where we can all get a good night's sleep!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a clear picture of the expenses and logistics before we decide. Let's be thorough so we don't run into any unexpected problems with the budget or the schedule.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to know exactly how we've handled money in the past! I'll look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets to see how the costs break down.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I believe it would be helpful to understand how our members have interacted in the past. I will look into the attendance sheets for the away camps and what the seniors say about year-groups mixing.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings. We need to ensure the workload is manageable for the organizers.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like staying there! I'll check the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds. Let's find a great spot!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the group transport in three years of receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets. I want to be absolutely certain about the actual costs before we announce any fees.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Wait, Misaki is looking into the same things as me! That's okay, we can compare notes later. I'm still really curious about how the final bills actually worked out for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is quite alright for two people to look into the same things; it ensures we have a very accurate picture. I am simply hoping we can find a way to encourage everyone to mingle.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Efficiency is key. If we overlap our research, we can verify the data more quickly. My focus remains on the operational burden to ensure no one is overwhelmed by the arrangements this year.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I don't mind if we overlap! As long as we find a place that isn't boring and doesn't make us all zombies by the last day. I'm super curious about those inland clubs!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,It's fine. Having a second pair of eyes on the financial documents will help prevent any errors. I just want to make sure we have a realistic budget this time.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we're all on the same page! I'll stick with the transport receipts and the whole-building let terms. Let's see what we find and make this the best camp ever!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall stick with the attendance sheets and the seniors' advice on mixing year-groups. I hope these insights will help us create a warm, inclusive atmosphere for everyone. I wish you all luck with your research.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will proceed with the canteen closure and cooking duty records, and the public group booking lottery. It is essential to understand the labor involved to prevent a repeat of last year's burden.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm sticking with the inland club accounts and the prefecture rate sheet! I'll find out if those beds are actually comfy or just fancy-looking. Let's go find the perfect spot!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will proceed with the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets. I'll be looking for any discrepancies between the quotes and the final payments.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
